      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n7. A similar matter was considered by a co-ordinate Bench of this Court in Anil Kumar Singla's case (supra), wherein quashing of an FIR registered under Sections 420, 272, 273, 274 & 120-B of the IPC, was sought."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3f71c449ac5840538bec4ea43f366722_50",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In that case, 7000 Lts. of adulterated milk, 19 quintals of cheese, 24 quintals of desi ghee, 40 kgs butter, 367 bags dry milk, 15 cans of refined oil, 15 bags of castic soda, 300 packets of fena (surf) besides 6500 fake/forged logos of Shr"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "257dfb3686e2448aa1bdefb96c245312_51",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On analysis, the samples of the recovered substances were found to be sub-standarad."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "af0828316bb448479056ae2c130810dd_52",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Contention was raised that Food Safety and Standarad Act, 2006 is a comprehensive and self-contained legislation, being a Special Act covering the domain of food safety and standarad and therefore, the provisions of IPC would not be applied"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "621e01d1b0a54e6aa78c44d27b6de9ea_53",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It was also contended that the investigating agency had acted upon the role of the food safety analyst and that analysis had been conducted in accordance with the provisions of Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006 and that Section 29 of the A"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a1ac1e1ec7884f8ab975a23adb2a5bd9_54",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Still further, it was contended that the appointment of the Food Safety Officers has been provided for under Section 37 of the Act and powers of said officers was provided under Section 38 of the Act."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a51577a2e949481c94b1494b4c7939a5_55",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Power to conduct search and seizure were prescribed under Sections 41 & 42 of the Act and that petitioners could be penalized only under the provisions of Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006 as per the rules laid therein."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f5acfdd14ffe42b298808e98a7cb8af7_56",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This Court referred to the various provisions of Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006 and concluded that where there is Special Act governing the field of food adulteration, the provisions of IPC are not attracted."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "333db5747a0446cc929e31c58fbb15f3_57",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS",
        "explicit_leakage_phrase"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [
        {
          "pattern": "\\bquashed\\b",
          "matched_text": "quashed",
          "start": 198,
          "end": 205
        }
      ],
      "text_preview": "It was further held that while the proceedings under the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act and Food Safety and Standard Act were maintainable, the FIR registered under the provisions of IPC stood quashed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b32cc144b668406fb62b9dfb5b23816b_58",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS",
        "explicit_leakage_phrase"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [
        {
          "pattern": "\\bquashed\\b",
          "matched_text": "quashed",
          "start": 16,
          "end": 23
        }
      ],
      "text_preview": "This Court then quashed the FIR in question."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5762776586fc4feaaf10653719b026fc_59",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "8. In the present case also, the allegations against the petitioners are regarding preparation and selling of the spurious ghee by putting labels of named companies."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "00f9eaa535194b39a7c8d5d028f828e6_60",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Said offences are prima facie covered under the provisions of Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "82e6692f5b964d34a5f2ce3d5b8bd747_62",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n9. Section 29 of the Act provides for the authorities responsible for the Enforcement of the Act."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d18500d7f0ef4ae895ac3a02d3389c50_63",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nSection 37 of the Act provide for appointment of the Food Safety Officer, whose powers are prescribed under Section 38 of the Act."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "73e28fe795f24d41a2d96e51d1440ded_64",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Section 41 gives power of search, seizure, investigation,\nprosecution and procedure thereof."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "55a8b93c3eee4fb6983ac8a3cf4e9601_65",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Besides Section 42 provides for procedure for launching of the prosecution."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2354d5a4b6d1429ba55abe6d8037a2ce_66",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "10. In the present case, as per the police report, the samples of the recovered articles were found to be sub-standard."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9576b005dbe3411aae0f344e61c7c79e_67",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As it has been alleged that Page N: 7 of 8 Pages 7 of 8 Neutral Citation Bachan Lal vs State Of Haryana on 4 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/91953516/\n"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "77e19e0ec3b0451cb494fb07f152b656_68",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "5 No:=2024:PHHC:000071 CRM-M-41130-2023 & 2024:PHHC:000070 CRM-M-43425-2023 2024:PHHC:000071 labels of some reknowned companies were also found at the spot and that by using those labels, the spurious ghee was being sold, so prima facie, th"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "36dda210c236438c8e50b497969d1b30_69",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In all these circumstances, it is a moot point as to whether provisions of IPC can be attracted in such like circumstances for keeping in possession the fake labels of famous companies for the purpose of selling the spurious ghee."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1027f9a3ac3d465dbcf66f8b525320e7_70",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Apart from this, investigation is already complete."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8391be3e179c4f3592236ed235d152cc_71",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Challan has already been filed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b1d82c23b61d4f579a1528b77e8dd71b_72",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The police report reveals that none of the petitioners have any criminal antecedents."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b2f1f6c3327b4c8e9f2754215f118d17_73",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Both of them are in custody for the last more than 06 months."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b7dadc5b80f4407e8dd123ca0a92ac18_74",
